Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:19:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add multiple native agents directly from a project room

Replace the confusing single-agent task detour with per-client member counts. Create empty independent chat sessions, preserve partial success without replay, and save the selected members without implicit tool grants. Verify same-provider sessions never enqueue work and exercise mixed-agent creation, limits and failures with fakes.
